## Features

- Component-based architecture for Eleventy and Nunjucks.
- Built-in layouts for documentation, landing pages, and posts.
- Accessible, dark-mode first responsive styling.

## Installation

```bash
npm install {{PACKAGE_NAME}}
```

## Quick Start

Add the theme to your `eleventy.config.js`:

```javascript
import theme from '{{PACKAGE_NAME}}';

export default function(eleventyConfig) {
  eleventyConfig.addPlugin(theme);
}
```

## Configuration

Configure theme options in your project's data directory or configuration file.

## Development

